        },
        "valueString": "Fever at home to 38.7°C over the last 2 days, gradual onset; sore throat, mild dry cough, achiness, mild headache, tiredness, and reduced eating. Drinking okay and passing urine normally. Denies shortness of breath, chest pain, abdominal pain, nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, and rash. No hives or swelling this episode."
