        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Looks a bit tired but comfortable and talking in full sentences. Throat with mild erythema, no exudate, and no enlarged tonsils. Mildly tender anterior cervical nodes. Chest clear with good air entry and no wheeze or crackles. No rash, urticaria, or lip/tongue swelling. Cardiovascular and abdominal examinations NAD."
